# LF in the repository and in every working tree. Without eol, a Windows
# checkout converts back to CRLF and the shell scripts stop running.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Forced text, so a NUL cannot flip one of these to binary and take its diff out
# of review. Keeping the NUL out belongs to check-control-characters.sh, which
# covers the same set.
*.cs text
*.json text
*.md text
*.props text
*.py text
*.sh text
*.slnx text
*.yaml text
*.yml text
